Cortex use: bounded recall before external or repository search when prior
work likely exists; treat lexical matches as discovery hints; cite the exact
Cortex resource and producing evidence where applicable (for computed
evidence, the property result address, not a transcribed value). Persist only
findings reusable beyond the current answer; write nothing when returning
NO_SEARCH_NEEDED. Do not continue conversations, run entity properties, or
manage the workspace.
